e, a person's confirmation, the answer given).\n> - need_human: a person has to give, do, decide, confirm or verify something (a card you posted included), or answer a question you asked: kind \"need_human\" with need, what they have to give, do or decide (to verify: where, how and what to look at). If work you started is pending too, mention it after the ask in need.\n> - waiting: only work you started that will bring you back on its own (a background command or agent, a job, a loop watching CI), with nothing asked of anyone, and nothing else you can do meanwhile: chat_state \"waiting\" with seconds, your estimate of how long until it does, and for, what you wait for. Waiting on a person is need_human.\n> - Otherwise: continue the work.","attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1792456791577,"mine":false,"system":true,"reportable":true,"by":{"name":"still.fail"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"at":1792456791577,"ago":"11 分钟前","full":"10/20 08:39:51","until":"1 分钟内","past":true}}},{"seq":25,"thread":1,"ts":"1792456795.788000","authorKind":"person","author":"alice@example.test","authorName":"Name of alice","text":"给个表格 082947 md:表格和代码 082947","attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1792456795788,"mine":true,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Name of alice","picture":"https://example.test/p.png"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"at":1792456795788,"ago":"11 分钟前","full":"10/20 08:39:55","until":"1 分钟内","past":true}}},{"seq":26,"thread":1,"ts":"1792456795.831000","authorKind":"agent","author":"ember:c-686b9caa18","text":"表格和代码 082947\n\n| 页面 | 状态 | 耗时 |\n|:--|:-:|--:|\n| 首页 | 完成 | 1.2 s |\n| 聊天页的列表和输入框 | 进行中 | 3.4 s |\n\n```ts\nexport function placeRows(rows: Row[], from: number): number {\n  const visible = rows.filter((r) => r.top >= from && r.top < from + window.innerHeight * 2) // only the rows near the screen\n  return visible.length\n}\n```\n\n详见 https://example.com/e2e/082947","attachments":[],"quotes":[],"declared":"final","ending":"all_done","createdAt":1792456795831,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"默认模型","agent":"ember:c-686b9caa18","runtime":"claude","here":true},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"at":1792456795831,"ago":"11 分钟前","full":"10/20 08:39:55","until":"1 分钟内","past":true}}},{"seq":27,"thread":1,"ts":"1792456806.036000","authorKind":"person","author":"alice@example.test","authorName":"Name of alice","text":"给个链接 082947 md:链接 082947","attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1792456806036,"mine":true,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Name of alice","picture":"https://example.test/p.png"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"at":1792456806036,"ago":"11 分钟前","full":"10/20 08:40:06","until":"1 分钟内","past":true}}},{"seq":28,"thread":1,"ts":"1792456806.041000","authorKind":"agent","author":"ember:c-686b9caa18","text":"链接 082947\n\n| 页面 | 状态 | 耗时 |\n|:--|:-:|--:|\n| 首页 | 完成 | 1.2 s |\n| 聊天页的列表和输入框 | 进行中 | 3.4 s |\n\n```ts\nexport function placeRows(rows: Row[], from: number): number {\n  const visible = rows.filter((r) => r.top >= from && r.top < from + window.innerHeight * 2) // only the rows near the screen\n  return visible.length\n}\n```\n\n详见 https://example.com/e2e/082947","attachments":[],"quotes":[],"declared":"final","ending":"all_done","createdAt":1792456806041,"mine":false,"system":false,"by":{"name":"默认模型","agent":"ember:c-686b9caa18","runtime":"claude","here":true},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"at":1792456806041,"ago":"11 分钟前","full":"10/20 08:40:06","until":"1 分钟内","past":true}}},{"seq":29,"thread":1,"ts":"1792456884.547000","authorKind":"person","author":"alice@example.test","authorName":"Name of alice","text":"看看这个文件 084051\nstudio 上的文件：/tmp/mbe2e-A/home/e2e-084051/说明.txt","attachments":[],"quotes":[],"createdAt":1792456884547,"mine":true,"system":false,"by":{"name":"Name of alice","picture":"https://example.test/p.png"},"waiting":false,"time":{"createdAt":{"at":1792456884547,"ago":"10 分钟前","full":"10/20 08:41:24","until":"1 分钟内","past":true}}},{"seq":30,"thread":1,"ts":"1792456884.